doc:sch-1-sec-52 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "52 Transitional" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "For the purposes of the application of Part ID of the Crimes Act 1914 after the commencement of this item, a reference to the Commonwealth DNA database system is taken, in relation to a thing that happened before that commencement, to include a reference to the DNA database system (within the meaning of that Act as in force immediately before that commencement).  [Minister’s second reading speech made in— Senate on 21 June 2006 House of Representatives on 18 October 2006]  (99/06)    Crimes Act Amendment (Forensic Procedures) Act (No. 1) 2006       No. 130, 2006            13" ;
    cof:pageNumber "16"^^xsd:integer .